    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Beta Access</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The first version of Early Access sends you straight back to April 2003, in the heart of Iraq, in the midst of a frighteningly intense confrontation. Scoot around the streets of Baghdad, near Firdos Square, frozen in the days of Saddam Hussein's regime. A unique and exceptional experience never seen before.</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Iraq, April 2003</strong>\u00a0- The United States and its allies launch <i>Operation Iraqi Freedom</i>, supposedly to rid the country of weapons of mass destruction and toppling its dictator. In the wake of the devastating 9/11 attacks, President George W. Bush is determined to seek historic revenge against what he calls the <i>Axis of Evil</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the streets of Baghdad to the rugged mountains of Tora Bora, <strong>WAR OPERATION\u2122: Full Contact</strong> thrusts you into the heart of the most intense modern conflicts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A museum-grade reconstruction of Baghdad\u2019s historic Firdos Square and many other key locations immerses you in a truly unique and powerful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932950/extras/03df98995913dee56cd82204b53dbf9b.webp?t=1751909817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WAR OPERATION\u2122: Full Contact</strong>, in its very first early access version, offers 16-versus-16 game modes: <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>, <strong>Zone Capture</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Rescue, </strong>and <strong>Statue-Toppling</strong> modes\u00a0-<strong>\u00a0</strong>all set across stunning and realistic modern-day environments in a fast-paced third-person shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932950/extras/385c4472f450e34a284dd67b4befc21d.webp?t=1751909817\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Technical features of Early Access - First Version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  1 iconic map: Firdos Square</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  2 camps: The American marines against the Iraqi Army including the Fedayeen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 gamemodes : Team deathmatch, Zone control, Rescue, Toppling mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Integrated online chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Online Ranking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  A unique soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Dynamic gameplay and characters movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Dynamic sound system</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Iraq, April 2003</strong>\u00a0- The United States and its allies launch <i>Operation Iraqi Freedom</i>, supposedly to rid the country of weapons of mass destruction and toppling its dictator. In the wake of the devastating 9/11 attacks, President George W. Bush is determined to seek historic revenge against what he calls the <i>Axis of Evil</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the streets of Baghdad to the rugged mountains of Tora Bora, <strong>WAR OPERATION\u2122: Full Contact</strong> thrusts you into the heart of the most intense modern conflicts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A museum-grade reconstruction of Baghdad\u2019s historic Firdos Square and many other key locations immerses you in a truly unique and powerful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932950/extras/03df98995913dee56cd82204b53dbf9b.webp?t=1751909817\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WAR OPERATION\u2122: Full Contact</strong>, in its very first early access version, offers 16-versus-16 game modes: <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>, <strong>Zone Capture</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Rescue, </strong>and <strong>Statue-Toppling</strong> modes\u00a0-<strong>\u00a0</strong>all set across stunning and realistic modern-day environments in a fast-paced third-person shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932950/extras/385c4472f450e34a284dd67b4befc21d.webp?t=1751909817\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Technical features of Early Access - First Version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  1 iconic map: Firdos Square</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  2 camps: The American marines against the Iraqi Army including the Fedayeen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 gamemodes : Team deathmatch, Zone control, Rescue, Toppling mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Integrated online chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Online Ranking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  A unique soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Dynamic gameplay and characters movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Dynamic sound system</p></li></ul>",
